number\">①</div>\n            <div class=\"list-content\">\n                使cell具有相对稳定的内部环境<br>\n                <div class=\"indent-text\">\n                    同时，在cell与外部环境进行物质运输、能量转<br>\n                    化、信息传递的过程中起决定性作用.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"list-number\">②</div>\n            <div class=\"list-content\">\n                广阔的膜面积为许多酶提供了附着位点.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"list-number\">③</div>\n            <div class=\"list-content\">\n                分隔 &rarr; 保证了cell生命活动高效，有序的<br>\n                <div class=\"indent-text\">进行.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Divider -->\n        <div class=\"divider-line\"></div>\n        \n        <!-- Bottom Section -->\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\">cell核控制着cell的代谢和遗传</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"complex-tree\">\n            <div class=\"complex-root\">\n                cell核\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"complex-branches\">\n                <div class=\"complex-branch-item\">\n                    <div class=\"complex-line\">/</div>\n                    <div class=\"complex-content\">核膜 · 双层 · 外隔</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"complex-branch-item\">\n                    <div class=\"complex-line\">&mdash;</div>\n                    <div class=\"complex-content\">\n                        <div>核仁：与某种RNA的合成以及核糖</div>\n                        <div style=\"margin-left: 3.5em;\">体的形成有关</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"complex-branch-item\">\n                    <div class=\"complex-line\">\\&nbsp;</div>\n                    <div class=\"complex-content\">\n                        <div>染色质 &rarr; 由DNA和Pro组成</div>\n                        <div style=\"margin-left: 4.5em;\">&darr; 遗传信息的载体</d